<Base
  title="Einbürgerungstest: Leben in DE · support"
  description="Help for Einbürgerungstest: Leben in DE, the free, ad-free app for the German citizenship test."
>
  <PageHead title="einbürgerungstest" intro="All 310 questions of the German citizenship test, in German and your language. Free, no ads, no account." />
  <div class="measure doc">
    <h2>Help</h2>
    <p><b>Where is my progress?</b> On your iPhone or iPad only. There is no account, so progress does not move between devices. Deleting the app deletes it.</p>
    <p><b>How is "estimated score today" worked out?</b> From how well you know each question: a question you have answered right twice in a row counts as mastered. The real test has 33 questions and you need 17 to pass.</p>
    <p><b>Where do the questions come from?</b> The official catalogue published by the Bundesamt für Migration und Flüchtlinge (BAMF). The app is independent and not affiliated with BAMF or any German authority.</p>
    <p><b>Something wrong in a translation?</b> Write to <a href="mailto:hello@mail.littleunknown.com">hello@mail.littleunknown.com</a> with the question number.</p>
    <p><a href="/apps/einbuergerungstest/privacy/">Privacy policy →</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>
  .doc { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .doc h2 { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
</style>
